  "question": "Combine the pre-task requirement state with the current client task. If the task determines a unique post-task state, choose ACT and construct that state; otherwise choose CLARIFY and identify the blocking requirement field and the question that must be answered.",
  "target_task": {
    "source_message_id": 19,
    "speaker": "client",
    "text": "Team-Building Update — Our Selection Process Is Changing\n\nWe received an overwhelming response to this role, with many people repeatedly returning to show their interest. Because of that, we’ve revised how we select the team.\n\nA pre-call screening form will now replace the trial clip. This approach allows us to assemble the strongest possible crew from the outset—people who are the right overall fit, rather than simply the right editors.\n\nWhat happens next is straightforward: complete the form below, and we will review every submission. Passing means immediate admission to the team, along with the full guidelines, account access, and a configured payment tracker so you can begin earning right away.\n\nThere is no trial and no waiting around. You submit the form, we make a decision, and then we move forward.\n\n<https://notes.emberframe.example/p/editorial-dashboard-4827?pvs=204>\n\nCapacity is limited because we are not trying to create a large crowd. The goal is a small, high-output crew. If you have continued showing up and replying consistently, this is your opportunity.\n\nComplete the form now."
  },
  "history_pool": {
    "boundary": "STRICTLY_BEFORE_TARGET_MESSAGE",
    "contains_target_message": false,
    "message_count": 18,
    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Hello, how's it going?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "To demonstrate the quality and consistency I can contribute to the team, I’m ready to complete the 6-clip trial.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Nikhil,\n\nYour detailed introduction checked every box, and your profile matches exactly what we need: manual editing, the right tools, strong volume capacity, and a long-term mindset.\n\nBefore anyone moves into the full contract, we follow the same standard onboarding process regardless of experience. Every clipper begins with a first paid milestone of 6 clips so we can confirm alignment on style and brand standards.\n\nPlease complete these steps:\n1\\. Review the YouTube channel and Instagram account I will share with you\n2\\. Create 6 clips using that content\n3\\. Submit them by Thursday\n\nApproval of your clips will trigger a video call, during which I’ll walk you through the full system: your daily task board, the payment dashboard that lets you track earnings daily, your assigned Instagram account, and everything else you need to hit the ground running.\n\nThe pay structure is:\n— $7.50 CPM per 1,000 views\n— $1200 maximum payout per clip\n— Weekly and monthly performance bonuses\n\nTo be direct, the Lead Clipper path is very much on the table as you grow with us, especially given your volume capacity and the leadership mindset you already demonstrated in your message.\n\nConfirm that you’re ready, and I’ll send the links now.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "<https://video.emberframe.example/@ardenvalevideo>",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I’m grateful for the opportunity and the thorough explanation of how the process works.\n\nAfter reviewing the content carefully, I’ll complete and submit the 6 paid trial clips by Thursday. I’m ready to move forward.\n\nThe transparency regarding the system, payment structure, and opportunities for growth within the team is appreciated. I look forward to learning more about the workflow and contributing to the brand’s long-term success.\n\nOnce you send the YouTube and Instagram links, I’ll get started right away.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Perfect Nikhil — welcome to the trial.\n\nHere are the links:\n\nYouTube: <https://video.emberframe.example/@ardenvalevideo>\n\nGo through the content, find 6 strong moments with good hooks, and clip them. No specific topic needed — just show us you can find a great moment and edit it cleanly.\n\nDeadline is Thursday. Looking forward to seeing your work.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thank you—I have the link. I’ll begin reviewing the content right away, then select 6 strong moments with compelling hooks and turn them into clean, engaging short-form clips.\n\nEverything will be ready and submitted before the Thursday deadline.\n\nI’m looking forward to showing you my work.\n\nBest,\nNikhil",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Hello,\n\nAttached for your review are the 6 trial clips, which I've now completed.\n\nWhile editing, I prioritized strong moments and engaging hooks, along with clean pacing and short-form retention, while keeping everything aligned with your content style.\n\nI'd appreciate your feedback, including any adjustments you'd like me to make. I look forward to hearing your thoughts and discussing the next steps.\n\nBest,\nNikhil",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "How are you, sir? Hello, and good morning.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "After I check them out in a bit, I'll let you know the next step.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Hey Nikhil ,\n\nFirst — your submission was good. You made it through and you're in.\n\nWe're currently finalizing the onboarding system on our end — training material, brand guidelines, and a full breakdown of exactly what we're looking for in every clip. We want to make sure that when you start, you have everything you need to hit the ground running the right way.\n\nSit tight. I'll be reaching out shortly to book a call so we can walk you through everything before you start clipping.\n\nAppreciate your patience. This is the beginning of something real.\n\n— Darius\nAudience Production Lead, Emberframe Studio",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I'm doing well; how about you?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Hi Darius,\n\nI'm excited to join the team and look forward to getting started. Thank you for the update and the opportunity.\n\nOnce everything is finalized, I'll be ready for both the onboarding process and the call.\n\nAppreciate it.\n\nBest,\nNikhil",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 15,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Regarding onboarding, Darius, I wanted to check in and ask whether there are any updates about the call or the next steps.\n\nI hope you’re doing well. Thank you for the update you shared earlier; I understand that you’re still finalizing everything on your side. I remain very interested in joining the team and am excited to begin.\n\nI look forward to hearing from you.\n\nThanks,\nNikhil",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 16,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Please do not worry, sir—tomorrow I will send you the next steps. We are currently finalizing the clipper's guideline and configuring your automated payment tracker. Rest today, and you will hear back from me tomorrow.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 17,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Please just call me bro, not sir 😊 Thank you so much again.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 18,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Are there any updates for me, Darius? Also, how have you been?",
        "milestone": null
      }
    ]
  },
